Description: Download YouTube video transcripts with Whisper fallback
 Auto-detects video language and tries manual -> auto-generated subtitles -> Whisper.
 Exports to txt, VTT, SRT, JSON, PDF, EPUB, DOCX with optional AI summarization.
 .
 yt-dlp is pulled in at runtime via pip if not already installed.
